{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"provium/src/typed/mir/parse.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-06T05:29:07.426490Z","id":"c26a9a777ea5d22e2d9836c728943576124681fceb1176016e52442b71d11e1d","body":{"detail":"jarl.mir line 2541: `_0 = {coroutine@jarl/src/host.rs:47:27: 51:2 (#0)} { ready: move _1, storage: move _2 };` (persist_async, the async fn's constructor). AggKind has tuple/array/adt/closure only. mir-lean --skip-unsupported leaves the body out of JarlMir.lean; the coroutine resume body persist_async::{closure#0} parses (its state types become Ty.other, downcasts use variant#k indices). Needs an AggKind.coroutine (span) or an explicit decision to keep async out of the MIR semantics.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":1339},"end":{"line":1339},"content_hash":"d32543c55f8577a5249c9d6865d89b30c421808332a764fa1078bf9029924660"},"summary":"Syntax.lean cannot express a coroutine aggregate, so Jarl's persist_async body is rejected","tags":["mir","syntax-gap","session:claude-code:a11d54e5-e61a-4ddb-ada4-de40e3db1dad"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"provium/src/typed/mir/parse.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-06T05:29:07.564978Z","id":"3a657de139eebdf87ff95a63ab5fdcbfeb7393509e25e39275966ca49cf09615","body":{"detail":"jarl.mir line 15153, body `<impl at jarl/src/lib.rs:127:1: 127:34>::fmt`: `_14 = const b\"!not leader; last known leader is \\xc0\\x00\";` (a &[u8; 36] template passed to Arguments::<'_>::new::<36, 1>). Const.str holds a String and the bytes are not UTF-8. mir-lean --skip-unsupported leaves the body out. Needs Const.bytes (List UInt8) or similar.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":1100},"end":{"line":1100},"content_hash":"9d0c14c18ffad5037d8717b33c4a9e852b061530c8c88ccf837f1583bd92b2d4"},"summary":"Syntax.lean has no byte-string Const, so Jarl's Display for Error (format_args with an argument) is rejected","tags":["mir","syntax-gap","session:claude-code:a11d54e5-e61a-4ddb-ada4-de40e3db1dad"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"provium/src/typed/mir/parse.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-06T05:50:18.902554Z","id":"7d02a154ec31caa46050f694a0a5ae08dd3967cd9ff60dc8507733dd40197e16","body":{"kind":"resolve","summary":"Fixed: Syntax.lean gained AggKind.coroutine; the parser emits it (span without the (#n) marker) and persist_async is in JarlMir.lean.","supersedes":"c26a9a777ea5d22e2d9836c728943576124681fceb1176016e52442b71d11e1d","tags":["session:claude-code:a11d54e5-e61a-4ddb-ada4-de40e3db1dad"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"provium/src/typed/mir/parse.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-06T05:50:18.936715Z","id":"d7b3a3ba84fc62792132559846be508b6e819d340c0e0136d2c6855f1598712d","body":{"kind":"resolve","summary":"Fixed: Syntax.lean gained Const.bytes; the parser emits b\"..\" literals as bytes and the Display for Error body is in JarlMir.lean.","supersedes":"3a657de139eebdf87ff95a63ab5fdcbfeb7393509e25e39275966ca49cf09615","tags":["session:claude-code:a11d54e5-e61a-4ddb-ada4-de40e3db1dad"]}}
